噢，斯坦利直接冲出了门。

682
00:31:08.200 --> 00:31:10.240
He books it, but he grabs his crossword.
他冲了出去，但还不忘带上他的填字游戏。

683
00:31:11.540 --> 00:31:12.900
Well, he knows.
嗯，他心里有数。

684
00:31:13.080 --> 00:31:14.580
He knows there's going to be a line.
他知道肯定会排长队。

685
00:31:14.960 --> 00:31:15.060
Yeah.
没错。

686
00:31:15.180 --> 00:31:15.320
Yeah.
是啊。

687
00:31:15.480 --> 00:31:16.560
He's planning ahead.
他提前做好了打算。

688
00:31:16.880 --> 00:31:18.000
He's ready for it.
他对此早有准备。

689
00:31:18.140 --> 00:31:20.680
I have a question, and this was also a fan catch.
我有个问题，这也是粉丝发现的。

690
00:31:20.880 --> 00:31:25.080
Kelly Rue asked, whose voice makes the announcement about Pretzel Day?
凯莉·鲁问，是谁的声音宣布的椒盐卷饼日？

691
00:31:25.080 --> 00:31:29.040
And Bailey Aspenson said, is that the voice of Billy Merchant?
贝利·阿斯彭森说，那是比利·默钱特的声音吗？

692
00:31:29.280 --> 00:31:29.760
It is.
确实是。

693
00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:31.020
It's Billy Merchant.
是比利·默钱特。

694
00:31:31.200 --> 00:31:31.700
Yes.
没错。

695
00:31:31.980 --> 00:31:34.220
Which makes sense because he's the building manager.
这很合理，因为他是大楼经理。

696
00:31:34.620 --> 00:31:34.920
Yeah.
是啊。

697
00:31:35.120 --> 00:31:39.380
I asked Kent Sabornak because there was a part of me that thought, is that Kent's voice?
我问了肯特·萨博纳克，因为我有一瞬间觉得，那会不会是肯特的声音？

698
00:31:39.620 --> 00:31:41.000
And Kent said, no.
肯特说，不是。

699
00:31:41.480 --> 00:31:46.180
Kent said they got Marcus York to record that audio for the announcement.
肯特说他们找了马库斯·约克来录制那段广播音频。

700
00:31:47.020 --> 00:31:47.560
Amazing.
太棒了。

701
00:31:47.800 --> 00:31:48.220
I love it.
我喜欢这个。

702
00:31:48.220 --> 00:31:49.060
I love the attention to detail.
我喜欢这种对细节的关注。

703
00:31:49.060 --> 00:31:50.040
I love the attention to detail.
我喜欢这种对细节的关注。

704
00:31:50.420 --> 00:31:51.380
I do, too.
我也是。

705
00:31:51.780 --> 00:31:57.260
So now we have the Stanley talking head that is one of my favorite talking heads, and Leslie's
现在我们有了斯坦利的访谈片段，这是我最喜欢的访谈片段之一，莱斯利的

706
00:31:57.260 --> 00:31:58.760
delivery of it is so great.
演绎简直太棒了。

707
00:31:58.980 --> 00:32:04.520
He says, I wake up every morning in a bed that's too small, drive my daughter to school
他说，我每天早上醒来，睡在太小的床上，开车送女儿去

