00:32:09.380 --> 00:32:10.720
But on Pretzel Day?
但在椒盐卷饼日呢？

710
00:32:11.520 --> 00:32:13.420
Well, I like Pretzel Day.
嗯，我喜欢椒盐卷饼日。

711
00:32:14.920 --> 00:32:20.060
That talking head that appears in the episode is an alternate talking head, Angela, that
剧集中出现的那个访谈片段是一个备选版本，安吉拉，那

