00:32:35.020 --> 00:32:40.820
My wife, my daughter, Pam Greer, and a hot, chewy roll of buttered dough.
我的妻子、我的女儿、帕姆·格里尔，还有热乎乎、有嚼劲的黄油面团卷。

721
00:32:41.240 --> 00:32:42.280
Pam Greer.
帕姆·格里尔。

722
00:32:43.520 --> 00:32:44.100
All right.
好吧。

723
00:32:44.300 --> 00:32:46.040
Fan question from Crystal White.
来自克里斯托·怀特的粉丝提问。

724
00:32:46.400 --> 00:32:52.500
Who came up with the idea of Pretzel Day, and were there actually pretzels for the cast
是谁想出了椒盐卷饼日的点子，拍摄现场真的有椒盐卷饼

725
00:32:52.500 --> 00:32:53.740
to eat on set?
供演员们吃吗？

726
00:32:54.340 --> 00:32:56.560
Thank you so much for your question, Crystal.
非常感谢你的提问，克里斯托。

727
00:32:56.860 --> 00:32:59.620
Okay, so we got a lot of pretzel-related questions.
好的，我们收到了很多关于椒盐卷饼的问题。

728
00:33:00.660 --> 00:33:04.900
Jenna, I know you did some digging around, and you got the real deal on this.
珍娜，我知道你做了一些调查，你拿到了这件事的真相。

729
00:33:05.020 --> 00:33:07.120
Yes, I found out some good stuff.
是的，我发现了一些有趣的事情。

730
00:33:07.300 --> 00:33:13.400
First off, BJ told me that the inspiration for Pretzel Day goes all the way back to season
首先，BJ告诉我，椒盐卷饼日的灵感可以追溯到第一

731
00:33:13.400 --> 00:33:13.800
one.
季。

732
00:33:14.480 --> 00:33:20.120
Greg took the writers on these fact-finding visits to real offices so that they could
格雷格带着编剧们去实地考察真正的办公室，这样他们就能

733
00:33:20.120 --> 00:33:22.760
get inspiration for storylines and episodes.
为故事情节和剧集寻找灵感。

734
00:33:23.120 --> 00:33:24.040
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

735
00:33:24.160 --> 00:33:26.720
Now, I know that Greg likes to do stuff like this.
我知道格雷格喜欢做这样的事情。

736
00:33:26.800 --> 00:33:31.520
I know when he was working on King of the Hill, he took all the writers to Austin, Texas,
我知道他在制作《山丘之王》时，带了所有编剧去德克萨斯州的奥斯汀，

