00:33:40.780 --> 00:33:43.740
Yes, and Lady, he even took them to a paper company.
是的，而且女士，他甚至带他们去了一家造纸公司。

741
00:33:43.960 --> 00:33:44.840
Oh, my God.
天哪。

742
00:33:45.120 --> 00:33:45.560
Amazing.
太神奇了。

743
00:33:46.080 --> 00:33:46.480
Yes.
是的。

744
00:33:46.680 --> 00:33:51.660
And BJ told me that on one of the days when they went to this office park, they were doing
BJ告诉我，在他们去那个办公园区的一天里，他们正在为员工进行

745
00:33:51.660 --> 00:33:55.800
some kind of morale-boosting free food giveaway for the employees.
某种提振士气的免费食物派送活动。

746
00:33:55.820 --> 00:33:56.880
It wasn't pretzels.
那不是椒盐卷饼。

747
00:33:56.880 --> 00:34:02.740
He thinks maybe it was popcorn, but everyone was really excited, and the writers put this
他觉得可能是爆米花，但每个人都非常兴奋，编剧们把这个

748
00:34:02.740 --> 00:34:09.320
idea on a card in the writer's room, and then BJ added the tidbit that Stanley would
点子写在了编剧室的卡片上，然后BJ补充了一个细节，即斯坦利会

749
00:34:09.320 --> 00:34:12.940
be the character that looked forward to this free food giveaway all year.
是那个整年都在期待这种免费食物派送的角色。

750
00:34:13.140 --> 00:34:14.320
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

751
00:34:14.440 --> 00:34:16.840
I love that so much, and it's so relatable.
我太喜欢这个了，而且非常有共鸣。

752
