他说他们搭建了“视频村”，也就是视频信号传输的地方。

1130
00:51:59.560 --> 00:52:02.280
It's a little tent with video monitors.
那是一个放着视频监视器的小帐篷。

1131
00:52:02.560 --> 00:52:08.680
And each camera goes into a different monitor so that the director can sit and see what the cameras are seeing.
每台摄像机都连接到不同的监视器上，这样导演就可以坐着看到摄像机拍摄的画面。

1132
00:52:08.880 --> 00:52:12.940
They had to build that in the middle of the two stages in a parking lot.
他们不得不在停车场两座摄影棚中间搭建这个设施。

1133
00:52:13.040 --> 00:52:14.540
They had to run phone lines.
他们必须铺设电话线。

1134
00:52:14.540 --> 00:52:22.660
They had to build a tent full of monitors and make sure they had enough cable that those monitors could be active and working.
他们必须搭建一个装满监视器的帐篷，并确保有足够的电缆让这些监视器正常工作。

1135
00:52:23.560 --> 00:52:24.000
Yes.
是的。

1136
00:52:24.200 --> 00:52:24.720
Oh, my God.
天哪。

1137
00:52:25.040 --> 00:52:30.220
Because the cable goes from the monitor through the parking lot, through the building, all the way to the camera.
因为电缆要从监视器穿过停车场，穿过大楼，一直连到摄像机上。

1138
00:52:30.380 --> 00:52:31.000
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1139
00:52:31.140 --> 00:52:32.780
So the director can see what was happening.
这样导演才能看到现场发生的情况。

1140
00:52:33.620 --> 00:52:36.560
Then they recorded audio on three different lines.
然后他们通过三条不同的线路录制音频。

1141
00:52:36.780 --> 00:52:38.500
They had a boom operator in with me.
我这边有一个吊杆麦克风操作员。

1142
00:52:38.580 --> 00:52:40.400
They had a boom operator in with John.
约翰那边也有一个吊杆麦克风操作员。

1143
00:52:40.400 --> 00:52:45.360
And then they were able to record the actual phone conversation through the phone line.
然后他们还能通过电话线录下实际的通话内容。

1144
00:52:45.660 --> 00:52:46.780
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1145
00:52:47.060 --> 00:52:49.500
It's very technically difficult.
这在技术上非常困难。

1146
00:52:49.780 --> 00:52:51.940
But the result is beautiful.
但效果非常棒。

1147
00:52:52.280 --> 00:53:00.020
And it made all the difference for John and I to be able to hear one another and to be able to really talk.
能够听到彼此的声音并进行真正的交谈，这对我和约翰来说意义重大。

1148
00:53:00.020 --> 00:53:09.240
One of the things I love about your conversation, which made it feel so real, is that you guys, you're just jumping all around on all these different subjects,
我喜欢你们对话的一点是，它感觉非常真实，你们在各种不同的话题之间跳跃，

1149
00:53:09.240 --> 00:53:14.560
just having this conversation because you haven't talked to each other in so long.
只是在进行这种对话，因为你们已经很久没有交谈过了。

