They just got to hear each other's voice.
他们只是听到了彼此的声音。

1168
00:54:24.740 --> 00:54:26.880
And it felt like home for a little bit.
那一刻感觉就像回到了家。

1169
00:54:27.400 --> 00:54:28.720
But it was everything.
但这意义非凡。

1170
00:54:29.220 --> 00:54:30.220
It was everything.
意义非凡。

1171
00:54:32.140 --> 00:54:33.020
I loved it.
我太喜欢了。

1172
